    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years after the Great Battle, circumstances lead to the breaking of the seals and the birth of a New God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been forced to change, and therefore you have changed, as has the way you perceive the world and the way the world perceives you. It is up to you to remain who you once were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you act on instinct, or do you fight for a greater purpose? Will your actions be in vain in the face of these new threats? Do you still retain your humanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissolve and coagulate. Discover water, earth, fire and air. Transform your raw material into the philosopher's stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/496f2ebee2e0e35e9693f1db8f719198.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemonium is a 2D soulslike metroidvania set in a kingdom deeply rooted in alchemy, reconquered by chaos. Explore its lands and ruins in search of answers... or revenge. Go forward, go back, get lost and find new paths that were hidden before. Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere, where a small black raven seems to be the only one who will guide you to your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/e619d3df55001118496636bc541cfb30.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With loneliness and death as your only companion, you must rely on your sword and your crossbow-arm to make your way through creatures born of flesh and chaos. Acquire new arrows and utilities and think of new ways to combine them to progress. Snatch the orbs and challenge the False God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/84f7b987c33701db2c7377ff67d7f8df.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years after the Great Battle, circumstances lead to the breaking of the seals and the birth of a New God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been forced to change, and therefore you have changed, as has the way you perceive the world and the way the world perceives you. It is up to you to remain who you once were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you act on instinct, or do you fight for a greater purpose? Will your actions be in vain in the face of these new threats? Do you still retain your humanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissolve and coagulate. Discover water, earth, fire and air. Transform your raw material into the philosopher's stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/496f2ebee2e0e35e9693f1db8f719198.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemonium is a 2D soulslike metroidvania set in a kingdom deeply rooted in alchemy, reconquered by chaos. Explore its lands and ruins in search of answers... or revenge. Go forward, go back, get lost and find new paths that were hidden before. Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere, where a small black raven seems to be the only one who will guide you to your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/e619d3df55001118496636bc541cfb30.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With loneliness and death as your only companion, you must rely on your sword and your crossbow-arm to make your way through creatures born of flesh and chaos. Acquire new arrows and utilities and think of new ways to combine them to progress. Snatch the orbs and challenge the False God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641730/extras/84f7b987c33701db2c7377ff67d7f8df.avif?t=1747785029\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
